    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Use free images provided by Pexels, Unsplash, Pixabay, Openverse, and Giphy directly from Gutenberg editor.</p>\n<h4>Supported Image Providers</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"http://pexels.com\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Pexels</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://unsplash.com\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Unsplash</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://pixabay.com\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Pixabay</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://wordpress.org/openverse/\" rel=\"ugc\">Openverse</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://giphy.com\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Giphy</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>External services</h3>\n<p>Image Hub routes all API requests to third-party image providers (such as Pexels, Unsplash, Pixabay, Openverse, Giphy) through our api service at api.wpimagehub.com</p>\n<p>This enables Image Hub to securely conceal API keys from public access and to deliver image data in a consistent, standardized format optimized for display in WordPress.</p>\n<p>We encourage you to review our Terms of Use and Privacy Policy before using the service.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://wpimagehub.com/terms-of-use/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Terms of Use</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://wpimagehub.com/privacy-policy/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Privacy Policy</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Source files</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/extendthemes/image-hub-wp\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">github</a></p>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release of Image Hub</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Image Hub",
    "description": "<p>Use free images provided by Pexels, Unsplash, Pixabay, Openverse, and Giphy directly from Gutenberg editor.</p>\n<h4>Supported Image Providers</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"http://pexels.com\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Pexels</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://unsplash.com\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Unsplash</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://pixabay.com\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Pixabay</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://wordpress.org/openverse/\" rel=\"ugc\">Openverse</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://giphy.com\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Giphy</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>External services</h3>\n<p>Image Hub routes all API requests to third-party image providers (such as Pexels, Unsplash, Pixabay, Openverse, Giphy) through our api service at api.wpimagehub.com</p>\n<p>This enables Image Hub to securely conceal API keys from public access and to deliver image data in a consistent, standardized format optimized for display in WordPress.</p>\n<p>We encourage you to review our Terms of Use and Privacy Policy before using the service.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://wpimagehub.com/terms-of-use/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Terms of Use</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://wpimagehub.com/privacy-policy/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Privacy Policy</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Source files</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/extendthemes/image-hub-wp\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">github</a></p>\n",
